# Cityscape Leveler: cast with no target ("up to one", CR 601.2c - nothing is destroyed and no Powerstone is made), then
# "whenever this creature attacks" (CR 508.1m, 603.2) on turn 3 targets Bot2's Mox Pearl, an opponent's nonland permanent
# (Bot2's Island is a land and is refused; Bot2's Mox Jet is no worse a target but is left alone). The Mox dies and Bot2, its
# controller, creates the tapped Powerstone. Bot2 untaps on turn 4: the Powerstone's {C} pays for Sol Ring ({1}, an artifact
# spell, CR 106.6), 8 trample damage went through on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Cityscape Leveler
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Island x4
Island x10

